sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Customer
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant P as Claim Pipeline
    participant R as Redis/SSE
    participant DB as Database

    U->>API: POST /api/claims/{id}/submit
    API->>DB: status = PROCESSING
    API->>O: dispatch(claim_id)

    par Phase 1 — Parallel (4 workers)
        P->>P: Policy Validation
        P->>P: RAG Retrieval
        P->>P: Customer Profile
        P->>P: Evidence Analysis (OCR)
    end

    P->>P: Fraud Detection (Groq LLM)
    P->>P: Decision Engine (rules)
    P->>P: Explainability (confidence score)
    P->>P: Payout Calculation (if approved)

    P->>DB: Persist decision + audit log
    P->>R: Progress events
    R-->>U: SSE /api/claims/{id}/stream
